 "text": "Douglas County, South Dakota -\nOctober 18, 2026\nDouglas County, South Dakota\nHome\nDirectory\nAuditor & Welfare Office\nCommunity Health Nurse\nDirector of Equalization\nDrainage\nEmergency Management\nHighway Department\nExtension/4-H\nPlanning and Zoning\nRegister of Deeds\nTreasurer\nVeteran’s Services\nCommission\nOrdinances\nCommissioners\nCommission Meetings\nCommission Minutes\nLaw & Court\nClerk of Courts\nSheriff\nState’s Attorney\nEmployment\nNotices\nCourthouse Hours:\nMonday-Friday 8:00 am to 4:30 pm (closed 12:00 pm-12:30 pm for lunch)\nDOUGLAS COUNTY RECREATION AREA- PLAYGROUND EQUIPMENT UPDATE\nThe Douglas County Recreation Area playground equipment is in dire need of replacement! Douglas County is in the process of applying for the Land & Water Conservation Fund (LWCF) Grant with the help of Planning and Development District III. The Application is available for public viewing here: Douglas County – LWCF Application 2026\nBURN BAN\nThe Burn Ban has TEMPORARILY been lifted. Please burn responsibly.\nCommissioner Meetings\n1st and 3rd Tuesday of each month. 9:00 a.m.\nDrivers Licensing\n2nd and 3rd Thursday of the month\n9:30 a.m. - 2:30 p.m.\nCommunity Room, 1st floor of Courthouse\nTREASURERS OFFICE: Vehicle Registration Renewals\nIn an effort to expedite the process, please bring the following with you:\nDrivers License & Registrations or Renewal Postcards for all vehicles.\nReturn to top of page\nCopyright © 2026 on Genesis Framework · WordPress · Log in",
